&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Purpose&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SentinelOne, we are driven by a clear purpose: to give the advantage to those who secure our future. As AI reshapes how organizations build, operate, and innovate, the responsibility to protect them becomes more critical than ever. When you join SentinelOne, your work helps protect global enterprises, critical infrastructure, and the technologies shaping tomorrow. If you are motivated by meaningful challenges and want your impact to be real, measurable, and global, you will find purpose here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SentinelOne is a company at the intersection of AI and security, pioneering a new operating model for cybersecurity. Our AI-native platform unifies protection across endpoint, cloud, identity, data, and AI systems to deliver autonomous detection and response with clarity and speed. By combining real-time analytics, intelligent automation, and a unified data foundation, we reduce noise, simplify complexity, and empower security teams to focus on what truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams are builders, problem-solvers, and innovators committed to shaping the future of security. If you are excited to solve hard problems alongside talented, mission-driven people, we invite you to help us build a safer future for humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Are We Looking For?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who are relentlessly curious and committed to continuous learning. AI is reshaping every function across our business, and we enable every team member, regardless of role or level, to build fluency in AI tools and concepts. Those who thrive here actively seek out new solutions, experiment thoughtfully, and apply what they learn to drive better, faster, smarter outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;As a Sr. Solutions Engineer, you will be tasked with driving adoption, building strong partner relationships, and evangelizing our solutions across the region. You will focus on enabling the MSSP ecosystem, positioning and integrating SentinelOne&#39;s technology within partner technical offerings, selling to the managed partner base, conducting demos, delivering technical training, Proof of Values, assisting partners with pre and post sales activities, and assisting with escalations. Your role will be responsible for managing our MSSP partners, while cultivating long-term relationships with partners, and the SentinelOne field and Product/Engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What will you do?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Primary responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Managed partner team to identify and qualify partnership opportunities, identify key partner technical objections, competition, and develop strategies to resolve technical blockers and scale the partner sales business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring feedback from partners and end customers to product management to improve the SentinelOne&#39;s solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive follow-ups with partner resources to consistently deliver on messaging how SentinelOne adds value to the partner and their customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and create go-to-market initiatives and offerings with SentinelOne partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute technical training plans for partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical relationship with SentinelOne&#39;s partners, and the coordination of additional technical resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver demonstrations and work hands-on with partners to demonstrate SentinelOne&#39;s value in the partner&#39;s environment or solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What skills and knowledge should you bring?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;10 Years+ in field, 5+ years Sales Engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Exceptional track record of growing managed partner technical resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong background in building relationships with internal sales and product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience presenting and delivering technical demos and sales values presentations to varying audiences from architects to C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Technical experience/skills for the successful candidate:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience working with CSPs, channel, MSP/MSSPs, GSIs, or alliances partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Ability to quickly learn, adapt, understand, and work with new emerging technologies, methodologies and solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Fluent Dutch and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel up to 50%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why SentinelOne?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is redefining how the world operates and rewriting the rules of security in real time, and SentinelOne was built for this moment. From day one, we architected an AI-native platform designed to operate at machine speed, not as an add-on to legacy systems but as the foundation itself. If you want to build where innovation and impact move together, this is that place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in our Sentinels with comprehensive, competitive benefits designed to support you and your family:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity &amp;amp; Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restricted Stock Units (RSUs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive leave benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-neutral parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insurance &amp;amp; Financial Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insurance and medical allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Perks &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global home office allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile phone reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter or work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Lifestyle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne participates in the E-Verify Program for all U.S. based roles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team’s mission is to align Vinted’s values, business goals, and Employer Value Proposition with our people’s real work experience. We translate Vinted’s truth into an inspiring story that attracts the right people, helps them grow, and instils them with pride.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll take an active role in Employer Branding at Vinted, with a particular focus on attracting engineering and data science talent. You’ll be based in Amsterdam, where our data science team is growing, but your work will reach candidates around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vinted has become an ecosystem with vertically integrated shipping and payments. This requires us to adapt our EVP to three very distinct brands and even more diversified hiring needs. Your job is to turn that into creative campaigns and stories that make specific audiences want to work here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our next big focus is storytelling. Bringing the skills and challenges our teams face to life! What is a day in the life of a cybersecurity analyst? How does an anti-money laundering expert keep members’ wallets safe? What does it take to build the data science behind a marketplace used by millions? And what stories does each of our locations need?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partnering with Talent Acquisition, engineering and data science leaders, People, Marketing, PR, Internal Comms, and Brand &amp;amp; Design, you’ll make sure those stories are told and that our presence is strong where we hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the guardian of Vinted’s employer brand, ensuring consistency and visibility across all platforms, like LinkedIn and Instagram&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong brand-building skills, with a clear vision of global vs local branding differentiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your sound understanding of branding and our editorial guidelines to write clear and engaging copy for things such as blogs, advertising campaigns, employer branding assets, email campaigns, event materials, online company profiles, as well as our careers pages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create bespoke or support partnership events such as meetups, webinars, and networking events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and run recruitment advertising, such as targeted LinkedIn campaigns and sponsorships with third-party publications and organisations, aimed at technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define where our global employer brand ends and local adaptation begins, so each location can tell its story while staying consistent with Vinted’s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape our content calendar around hiring needs and our location strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track what works, using results to sharpen the next activation, and share learnings with the wider Employer Branding team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about all things Employer Branding!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love storytelling: finding stories and having a keen eye for telling them in ways that stand out. You can show campaigns or activations you conceived and delivered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in building and nurturing online and offline communities, and delivering innovative events and social media campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear view of global vs local branding, and experience working across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at identifying new talent attraction channels, especially for engineering and data science audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using data to set goals and judge what worked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to juggle multiple projects with strong stakeholder management, and to work confidently with engineering and data science leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited by change, a fast pace, and learning new ways of doing things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of social media and digital channels, including LinkedIn, Glassdoor, Indeed, and Meta.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal English communication skills (English is Vinted’s official working language).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital mental and emotional health support and Employee Assistant Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€59.800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€81.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Analytics Engineer to join our Revenue, Purchase &amp;amp; Order Analytics Engineering team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The area sits at the heart of some of the most critical customer journeys and commercial systems across Vinted’s Marketplace Business Unit, spanning Revenue (pricing and advertising), Purchase (inquiries and checkout), and Orders (transactions and fulfilment). Together, these domains create a rich, high-volume, and deeply interconnected data ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Analytics Engineer, you’ll work at the intersection of data, engineering, and product, building trusted data products that power business and product decision-making across these domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable data products:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, develop, and evolve reliable, cost-efficient data products and pipelines that power analytics and machine learning use cases across the domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build quality in by design:&lt;/strong&gt; Embed automated testing, validation, and quality controls throughout the data lifecycle to ensure data remains accurate, consistent, and complete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen observability:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve monitoring and alerting to detect and address issues before they impact downstream consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own production reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Take end-to-end ownership of production data systems, from investigating incidents and diagnosing root causes to implementing durable fixes that prevent recurrence and improve long-term resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you’ll work with:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenue, Purchase &amp;amp; Order Analytics Engineering: Join a talented and driven team of 7+ Analytics Engineers, working across interconnected domains and tackling complex, high-impact data challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data &amp;amp; Decision Scientists: Work closely with Data Scientists and Decision Scientists to build trusted data foundations that enable better business and product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering, Product &amp;amp; Business: Partner with Backend Engineering, Product, and Business teams to understand their needs, shape technical requirements, and translate them into well-designed, trusted data solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Analytics Engineering Guild: Be an active member of Vinted’s 40+ member AE Guild, benefiting from shared tooling, engineering standards, and knowledge across domains. You’ll also have opportunities to contribute to “side quests” that improve engineering practices, tooling, and reusable capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working as an Analytics Engineer, Data Engineer, or in a closely related data role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL and data warehousing fundamentals, with the ability to build clean, performant, and maintainable data solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with dbt or a similar data transformation framework, building well-structured and tested data models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with a cloud data warehouse such as BigQuery, Snowflake, Redshift, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of data modelling principles and their application to real-world analytical problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with workflow orchestration tools such as Airflow, Dagster, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with high-volume, business-critical data, balancing a high bar for quality and reliability with a pragmatic bias for action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills in English, with the ability to clearly explain technical concepts and trade-offs to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance &lt;strong&gt;[[DELETE FOR Breda, Utrecht, Amsterdam Store]]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€53.900&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€72.900 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Build automation that powers the heart of our customers’ most critical operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we specialize in mission‑critical IT, partnering closely with our customers to keep their most essential systems running smoothly and securely with 100% responsibility. Our impact is driven by engineers who are deeply technical, automate everything, collaborate naturally, stay curious, take full end‑to‑end ownership, and understand the full stack - from application to core infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for engineers who flourish in automation‑first, mission‑critical environments and want to shape the platforms our customers rely on daily. In a self‑steering customer team, you design, build, run, and improve business‑critical systems across the full stack. You automate everything you touch, streamline pipelines, solve issues across the stack, and tune applications for performance. Working in a culture of real ownership, deep collaboration, and zero silos, where teams carry full responsibility for mission‑critical systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;/&amp;nbsp;What you will do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Mission‑Critical Automation Engineer, you design, build, run, and improve platforms. You automate everything you touch, diagnose and resolve issues across the entire stack, collaborate closely with customer teams, and take full end‑to‑end ownership of stability, security, and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your day-to-day includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building automation through scripting and configuration management tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the full Plan–Build–Run lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solving multi‑layer issues across OS, network, DB, security, and apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and executing controlled releases with Git and pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform‑hardening practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;/&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong automation mindset, with hands-on experience in advanced scripting and configuration management (e.g. Powershell, Ansible, DSC, Puppet, Chef).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Git and CI/CD practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying security principles in mission-critical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Infrastructure-as-Code tooling such as Terraform, Bicep, or ARM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ownership mentality, combined with curiosity and analytical thinking to understand and improve system behaviour end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of networking, database fundamentals, release/deployment lifecycles, and applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following would be a plus:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and running containerized environments (Docker).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrating platforms using Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operating in public or private cloud environments (Azure, AWS, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;/ Who are you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An engineer with strong specialization in a core technical domain, combined with a solid understanding of the broader system landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation-driven, preferring code over manual work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic problem solver who collaborates openly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter who thrives in a high-trust engineering culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated by complex systems, customer impact, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;/&amp;nbsp;What can you expect?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with highly skilled engineers who focus on automation, security, and delivering real customer impact. We prioritize quality and ownership over billable hours (“freedom &amp;amp; responsibility”).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A culture that supports continuous growth through training, mentoring, and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality offices, strong tech community involvement, and opportunities to experiment with new technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re an engineer in the Netherlands who defaults to automation, enjoys deep technical challenges, and drives real customer impact, we’d like to get in touch!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every Product Manager at Catawiki owns a meaningful part of the customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Search and Ranking, your mission is to help buyers find the special objects they care about. You will shape how search, ranking and personalisation work across the buyer journey, making discovery more relevant and helping more buyers find objects they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a broad product area. It brings together buyer needs, expert curation, marketplace priorities, search experiences and machine learning. You will identify the most important opportunities, set a clear direction and lead a cross functional team from insight to measurable customer and business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The solution is not prescribed. You may improve search relevance, ranking, recommendations or personalisation, or explore new AI enabled ways to help buyers discover objects. What matters is that you solve a meaningful customer problem, measure the impact and scale what works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the strategy, outcomes and execution for this area, working closely with Engineering, Design, Data Science, Marketing and Commercial teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and communicate a clear product vision, strategy and roadmap for Search and Ranking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own measurable outcomes across search relevance, discovery, engagement and buyer conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use behavioural data, customer research and commercial insight to identify and prioritise the biggest opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn ambiguous customer and business problems into clear hypotheses, prototypes and executable plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead initiatives from early discovery through experimentation, launch and scaling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success metrics and build a rigorous experimentation agenda for search, ranking and personalisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with machine learning engineers and data scientists to assess model quality, test new approaches and improve customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the relevance of search results and recommendations across the buyer journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate personalisation into the customer experience in ways that feel useful, coherent and trustworthy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, run and evaluate experiments, using positive, negative and inconclusive results to guide decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI and rapid prototyping to test ideas early, reduce development risk and accelerate learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clarity, momentum and accountability across teams, including when priorities or incentives differ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate strategy, performance, tradeoffs and recommendations clearly to senior and C level stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Three qualities matter most in this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;Outcome ownership&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You take responsibility for customer and business results, not only for delivering features. You stay with the problem, remove obstacles and change direction when the evidence calls for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;Systems thinking&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You understand how search, ranking, recommendations, auction dynamics, expert curation and marketplace health influence one another. You make thoughtful decisions across the full buyer journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experimental rigour&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You use data, research, prototypes and controlled experiments to make decisions. You learn from negative results and can distinguish meaningful progress from activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least five years of product management experience, preferably in consumer ecommerce, marketplaces or another digital product at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning a broad product area or customer journey, rather than only individual features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining product strategy or roadmaps for search, ranking, recommendations, personalisation or other machine learning products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with product metrics, experiments and commercial performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, running and analysing A/B tests, including tests involving machine learning products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to turn uncertain opportunities into clear hypotheses, prototypes and plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical understanding of machine learning concepts and how models become useful product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with machine learning engineers and data scientists to develop and improve customer facing features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using AI tools to prototype quickly and explore customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to balance immediate commercial opportunities with longer term product and platform investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication skills and the ability to influence senior leaders without relying on formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The pace, resilience and judgement to maintain a high standard of execution in an ambiguous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you will be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Amsterdam. We offer a relocation package for people currently living outside the Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Director, Global Operations Excellence&lt;/strong&gt; will be responsible for leading Operational Excellence, standardisation, transformation, and continuous improvement across the Sony Interactive Entertainment global supply chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in a fast-paced, highly collaborative environment, this senior leader will oversee a team of Lean experts and Operational Excellence business standardisation specialists, ensuring SIE Operations continues to improve service quality, reduce waste, increase efficiency, and deliver consistent, high-performing operational practices across all regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting into Global Operations, this role will act as a key transformation leader across the Operations division, partnering with Logistics, Warehousing, Planning, Transportation, Finance, Procurement, Commercial, D2C, Customer Service, and regional Operations teams to drive measurable improvements across cost, service, process maturity, and customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the global Operations Excellence agenda for SIE, defining and executing a transformation roadmap focused on standardisation, Lean capability, service partner development, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the Operations Lean Kaizen Office, driving Lean transformation activities across operational functions, including Kaizen events, value stream mapping, Gemba practices, waste reduction, cost improvement, and operational performance improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of global operational standards, ensuring SIE delivers a consistent, high-quality service experience to customers, retailers, commercial partners, and internal stakeholders across all markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central point for translating commercial, customer, and business requirements into operational solutions, ensuring requests are clearly assessed, prioritized, and converted into realistic delivery plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead global service partner development, including strategic tender activity, performance improvement, and commercial governance across warehousing 3PLs, control tower 4PLs, transportation partners, and other key Operations service providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee centralised budgetary analysis across Operations, supporting visibility, control, and governance of OPEX and CAPEX activities across the global supply chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate data-driven insights into operational performance, ways of working, service quality, cost drivers, and customer impact, using these insights to shape strategic and continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key areas of focus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Service Partner Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead global Operations tender activity across key warehousing 3PL, control tower 4PL, transportation, and logistics service partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Procurement, Finance, Legal, and regional Operations teams to ensure tender processes are commercially robust and operationally aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support service partner strategy, performance management, governance, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide budgetary oversight and centralised analysis of OPEX and CAPEX spend across Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve partner performance, cost efficiency, service delivery, and operational scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lean Transformation: Operations Lean Kaizen Office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the Operations Lean Kaizen Office as the centre of excellence for Lean transformation across SIE Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Lean continuous improvement activities across all operational areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support weekly and monthly S&amp;amp;OE practices, ensuring continuous improvement is embedded into operational routines and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and support Kaizen events, value stream mapping, Gemba walks, process diagnostics, and waste reduction initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver measurable improvements in efficiency, cost, service quality, process flow, and operational performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Lean capability across teams through coaching, standards, tools, and practical application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Distribution Excellence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee global operational standardisation across distribution, warehousing, transportation, and fulfilment practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure SIE delivers one consistent, high level of operational service excellence to its global customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop data-driven insights into how operational practices impact customers, commercial outcomes, cost, and service performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central funnel point for commercial and customer requests, translating business needs into operational realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify global best practices and scale them across regions, partners, and operational functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish performance metrics, governance forums, and improvement roadmaps to drive accountability and progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years’ experience in Operations, Supply Chain, Logistics, Operational Excellence, Lean Transformation, or a related global leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading Operational Excellence, Lean, continuous improvement, or business transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of global supply chain operations, including warehousing, transportation, distribution, 3PL/4PL management, and operational governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading or supporting global tenders, service partner development, and supplier performance improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial acumen, with experience overseeing or analyzing OPEX, CAPEX, cost performance, and budgetary controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience with Lean tools and methodologies, including Kaizen, value stream mapping, Gemba, standard work, waste reduction, and continuous improvement routines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to translate commercial and customer requirements into operational plans and scalable processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership skills, with experience managing high-performing teams of specialists or transformation experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical capability, with the ability to turn operational data into strategic insight and measurable improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills across Operations, Finance, Procurement, Commercial, Customer Service, and regional leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
